    <div class="text-sm font-extrabold text-[var(--text)] mb-1" id="footerStoreBrand">APK SZ Store</div>
    <p class="text-[11px] mb-2" id="footerStoreNotice">The premier hub for verified Android APKs and MODs.</p>
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[var(--bg)] px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] font-semibold text-[10px] text-emerald-600">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> 100% Virus & Malware Free Verified
    </div>
    <div class="mt-3 text-[10px] opacity-75">© 2026 APK SZ Store Inc. All Rights Reserved.</div>
    
